                <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4FE0B0' }}>价值在哪</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.8, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>学生机房、备考自学、久坐办公都能用；零账号、默认零联网，适合批量部署。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 10, padding: '22px 24px', background: 'rgba(79,224,176,0.12)', border: '1px solid #4FE0B0', borderRadius: 12 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#E8EEF7', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>说到底就一句：把一件"知道该做、却懒得去设"的事，变成<span style={{ color: '#4FE0B0', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>说一句话</span>的事。</Text>
